Package: PROregTMB
Title: Patient Reported Outcomes Regression with TMB
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dae-Jin", "Lee", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dlee@bcamath.org"),
    person("Josu", "Najera-Zuloaga", role = "aut"),
    person("Inmaculada", "Arostegui", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Reimplementation of beta-binomial regression models from
    PROreg using Template Model Builder (TMB) for automatic differentiation
    and Laplace approximation. Provides cross-sectional BBreg, mixed-effects
    BBmm (including multivariate shared latent and additive P-splines with
    Marra-Wood confidence bands), and a one-stage BB-Weibull joint model
    (BBjm). Uses Rcpp for BB simulation / log-density and Matrix for sparse
    RE designs.
